{"id":"ig_02","book":"ig","bookLabel":"Instagram & YouTube report","title":"What Works","tables":[{"cols":["A","K"],"rows":[["What kind of content works for us","","","","","","","","","",""],["Every table is live formulas over 'Post Log'. Hit rate = share of posts in the group that beat the account median for their creative type (50% = average; 65%+ = clearly working). It ignores a few viral outliers, unlike averages. Score columns fill in as watch data arrives. Groups with fewer than 5 posts are greyed out.","","","","","","","","","",""],[],["PLAYBOOK — what to stick to","","","","","","","","","",""],["HOOKS","Stick to: Conflict / shock reveal (64% beat median, 67 posts), Celebrity face (64% beat median, 39 posts). Drop or rework: Humour / meme (38%), Festival / topical tie-in (36%). Avg hook score so far 6.1/10.","","","","","","","","",""],["MID-ROLLS","Avg mid-roll score 5.0/10. Put a reveal, a shock beat or a new suspect at the halfway mark; if the midpoint is just more set-up, viewers drift.","","","","","","","","",""],["CLIFFHANGERS","Best endings: Twist tease (63% beat median, 62 posts), Open question (59% beat median, 169 posts). Weakest: Promise of payoff / revenge (38%), None (36%).","","","","","","","","",""],["CTA","Best CTAs: Download app / link (59% beat median, 59 posts), Watch on TukTuki (51% beat median, 351 posts). Weakest: Follow / share (30%). Pair whodunit endings with a comment prompt ('Comment karo, kaun hai asli gunehgaar?').","","","","","","","","",""],["LENGTH","Hit rate by length: 120s+ 57% (70), 31–60s 57% (109), 61–90s 56% (158), 91–120s 47% (60), 0–30s 26% (104). Aim for 120s+.","","","","","","","","",""],["CONTENT MIX","Lean into: Behind the scenes (75% beat median, 8 posts), Topical / trend (67% beat median, 6 posts). Cut back: Celebrity / podcast (25%), App / brand promo (8%).","","","","","","","","",""],["SHOWS","Strongest organic IP: Pyaar Ka Face Value (100% beat median, 9 posts), Psychopath (100% beat median, 10 posts), 